    "Use the existing public spaces_interpolation_product_bound on the original tuple, with q(real,x)=abs(real)+p(x). The interpolation base and loss precede both finite arities and every assigned factor order.",
    "B=max BJ (max BP (BK+d(0))) is selected before n. The last entry pays for the image's fixed low BK seminorm using only the zero jet.",
    "For fixed n, delta=sum_{j<=n}d(j). For each ordered partition c, its factor-order budget is e(length(c))+delta+length(c)*(BK+delta); only one factor contains spatial s.",
